AJAX = asyncrounous javascript and xml

use for dyanmic and fast website 
without page referesh to use the ajax to reload only specific part.

prefer to use jquery becuase minimum write of code to easy for the use in ajax.

implemention of AJAX
$.ajax({});

$(document).ready(function (){
    $(id).on(click,function (e){
        $.ajax({
            url: page name,
            type: GET/POST,
            data: string/array/object, //send the form data to this url file 
            success: function(data){ //if the successfully complete the operation to return data as a response using success
                $(id).html(data);
            }
        });
    });
});

offset calculation 

offset = (page number - 1) * LIMIT;

you can must use ceil function for return the next page number

serialize() = this method can convert form data into string

trigger() = after submit the form clear data to use this method
